6. Exception Handling
Scenario
Action
Authentication Failed
Reject Request
Authorization Failed
Reject Request
Invalid Hostname
Return Validation Error
API Failure
Update Status as PROVIDER FAILED
Timeout
Update Status as UNKNOWN
Successful Execution
Update Status as SUCCESS
7. Status Definitions
Status
Description
SUBMITTED
Request accepted by the system
IN PROGRESS
Reboot operation is currently running
SUCCESS
Reboot completed successfully
UNKNOWN
Unable to determine execution result
PROVIDER FAILED
Backend execution failed
